    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "HOW TO SURVIVE:\n\n\u2022 [W][A][S][D]: 360\xB0 Movement\n\u2022 [SPACE] / [SHIFT]: Dash with invulnerability\n\u2022 WEAPONS AUTO-AIM & FIRE AT FOES CONTINUOUSLY\n\u2022 Slay enemies to gather EXP (Level Up) & Cursed Seeds\n\u2022 Approach GRAVESTONES to plant seeds & gamble:\n   - 70% LUCKY: EXP bursts, HP heals, lethal damage buffs\n   - 30% CURSED: Monster ambushes, toxic puddles, slow\n\u2022 LUCKY LAST: Fatal hits are intercepted! Enter an 8s\n   berserk frenzy with +50% damage & +50% attack speed!\n\u2022 Survive 12 minutes to face 'THE LAST HARVEST' boss!"
